\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, April to May hit 146% of normal on the middle, then November to December fell to 54%. So far in 2026, February to March and March to April both sat at 48% of normal on the middle. The driest year on grid 19072 was 2007, at 72% of normal.</p>"}
